You forgot another option, which is the most common one in my case:
polymorph your existing pet into another creature. Polymorph traps can
be used over and over again for this purpose, as long as you don't use
them yourself (they'll disappear when you use them yourself, but they'll
stay if your pet uses them. Potions and wands are also nice for this,
but they have limited uses and are more versatile than traps, so you
might want to save those.

Another option is a chameleon corpse, but like the potion, this has the
disadvantage that if you get something you don't like, there's hardly a
way back.

